{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "12fef3c72189f718ad2b9369f058e3a1d050f5277d04420e4b242e4c4da7b26a", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nお帰りなさい、お待ちしてました♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n欢迎回来，我在等你呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "042fc28da825d836bff5663a096fc526e861c3b83a410ad888cfed060867a0d1", "ja": "ただいま戻りました、青羽さん。\n何かあったんですか？", "zh": "我回来了，青羽小姐。\n有什么事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "16e928ecfed29a07fad1fa70623da2809caa4d259811fa7e1e6350d926615b7a", "ja": "はい！　社長さんが、\n{$P$}さんをお呼びですよ。", "zh": "是的！社长他在找\n{$P$}先生喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "bbeb945f8ac3f3cc869137b28d72b41959dd6b6068d4a5e140c63a19e4429f83", "ja": "社長が？　わかりました、ありがとうございます！\nちょっと行ってきますね！", "zh": "社长找我？我知道了，谢谢你！\n我这就过去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "175b5e9da29f783bcafb0e1c5d4eefafb21eda3bab656e30458f2c56a59e21d5", "ja": "いってらっしゃーい！\nステキなお話だといいですね～。えへへ♪", "zh": "路上小心～！\n希望是件好事情～嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_1005_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "214ba042c1d731eefaad2b3976165cf6fc7af641c5738d5aeb6a36c1dc52be9f", "ja": "社長、失礼します！", "zh": "社长，打扰了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_1007_president", "source_sha256": "d6d3ba2541820f8bfcc3a90d922ef070292fecae6e9c83ed00d1c04ff27eae8d", "ja": "おお、君！　待っていたんだよ。\nいやぁ、この間のユニット公演も大成功だったね！", "zh": "喔喔，你来啦！我在等你呢。\n不是我在说，之前的团体公演真的非常成功呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_1008_president", "source_sha256": "a71d2e14c2f5c266e114b4f4592cef07bfb407ccb8bdb6ef1117fd3f3104f187", "ja": "巷は、765プロライブ劇場の話題で持ち切りだ。\nやはり、君に劇場を任せて正解だった！", "zh": "街头巷尾都在讨论我们765艺能演唱会剧场。\n把剧场交给你果然是正确的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4593082902fda222fae6346ef0cdfaa9b9e8dca39bace7bfae4e67b9eba81cc3", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\nアイドルのみんなが頑張ってくれてるおかげです。", "zh": "谢谢您的夸奖。\n这都要感谢偶像们的努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_1010_101kot", "source_sha256": "37592dc4e8bf684a9397af42b1b25938a9ba9b297312cc0477e1b63fd24b7b64", "ja": "ふふっ、{$P$}さんだって、\nしっかりご活躍なさってますよね！", "zh": "呵呵，{$P$}先生，\n你自己也十分活跃喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "fcf28951ea05b1d89dfe414302b3153aa30a7b000f58c6e9fbebec67ae76df64", "ja": "公演を柱の影からこっそり覗き見ていた私の目は、\nごまかせませんよ♪", "zh": "公演时我都有躲在柱子后面偷看，\n所以瞒不过我的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "103c2ef631462c9d1e06378151361bae4e22a0319eb7eb92bee17e7a23215145", "ja": "そ、そうですか。\n別に隠れなくてもいいのに……。", "zh": "这、这样啊。\n其实也不用躲起来看吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "d82fc030b6f9d2c858740d833aec7eaa80c554492ff2b1367925fc875feb76cf", "ja": "リピーターのお客さんも増えてきたって、\n美咲ちゃんも喜んでました♪", "zh": "而且回头客也变多了，\n美咲也很开心呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "1ffaf41af39ee4d3b584f8abae9aa112925f1112d6451de3771be600e40f5cbf", "ja": "そうなんです。そういう方たちのためにも、\nそろそろ新しい企画を打ちたいかな、と……。", "zh": "是啊。所以为了那些回头客，\n我想也该准备新的企划了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "1c9d8bd76d81f2187be73f9a8ee730e4f00fea93c8037fa945084de6b88c165d", "ja": "そう、だからこそ君を呼び出したのだよ！\n次のユニット公演の話をするためにね。", "zh": "没错，我就是为此找你过来的！\n就是要找你讨论下次团体公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d30d77b2bb35cae1386a5f0a58c1c04f614b8b8275b0efaf1ad4cdc37b12501e", "ja": "次の……新しいユニットですか！", "zh": "下次公演……是新的团体吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "d35174912870461bd59b1c9dce1c475bb0d24974cccf5a57305bf969e96002dd", "ja": "その通り。そしてそのユニットは、\n星井美希君に率いてもらおうと思っている！", "zh": "正是如此。\n而且我想要让星井美希率领这个新团体！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "142f75fd15944462cf569c3dfc145d152ebe16e94c97124ef044395a8167c8d7", "ja": "メンバーは、天空橋朋花君、高山紗代子君、\n永吉昴君、二階堂千鶴君。", "zh": "其他成员还有：天空桥朋花、高山纱代子、\n永吉昴、二阶堂千鹤。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "10208a861efdd113bb17b7f17f2a8d2a50f167c419337e161a9576d6ff27c7bc", "ja": "ユニット名は『ミルキーウェイ』だ！\nふふふ、ロマンチックだろう？", "zh": "团体名称叫做『Milky Way』！\n哼哼哼，听起来很浪漫吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "3bc2452b6995483f11d0db321a5eb3e4d067cf52bb49fee80681f624ae405b36", "ja": "ミルキーウェイ……\nつまり天の川、というわけですね。", "zh": "『Milky Way』……\n是银河的意思，对吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "256a83c27a1e5ec9f7fb006c6d9dd363e645a8d673fcd8bfd37c9ae8eea4578c", "ja": "うむ、彼女たちならば、誰もが見上げる天の川のように\n輝いてくれることだろう！", "zh": "嗯，她们散发的光芒肯定能像天上的银河一样，\n让所有人都抬头仰望吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_1022_101kot", "source_sha256": "647b0cb9b2d36106025da516597901f1251e69dcf8e9b04b816962a7246636e4", "ja": "天の川といえば、織姫と彦星のお話って、\nステキですよね♪　離れ離れになった恋人同士……。", "zh": "说到银河，就会想到牛郎织女，\n真的很棒呢♪分隔两地的情人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_1023_101kot", "source_sha256": "71294c212db175551959ed54f22c2d73d201e818902e1d4ec5b69e1e8e4ece89", "ja": "一年に一日しか会えなくて。\n一日に一年分の愛をこめて……、はぁ……！", "zh": "一年只有一天能够相会。\n把一年份的爱都放在这一天……唉……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "954fdc2a2f611fb3971488fa53f6d274cb94b1637fc15ccc46530d7a4d9e3083", "ja": "…音無君？　話を続けていいかな？", "zh": "……音无？我可以继续了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_1025_101kot", "source_sha256": "31796d9470b4a1fb384b351d53453af53d32244ee899a03e5131168534178f06", "ja": "はっ！？　す、すみません、どうぞ！\nお気のすむまで！", "zh": "啊！？对、对不起，请继续吧！\n讲到您开心为止！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "5ddf5f344ae16e69ee8e64aea57a77c8731b2bededff9797991bed74251f75dc", "ja": "ウォッホン。あー、というわけで……。", "zh": "咳咳，这个──所以呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "49c4c2a36009b3fd80ce01e52429c15e467581f17950a6c96d4d9e2e595a08fe", "ja": "ミルキーウェイのアイドル諸君は皆、素晴らしい才能を\n持っているが、それだけで輝くことは難しいものだ。", "zh": "虽然『Milky Way』的偶像们个个才华出众，\n但光靠才华还不足以绽放光芒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_1028_president", "source_sha256": "44361e9532a57e765a20f7b00f9dca3b8328daa37f8057de235f9685082663e9", "ja": "これまでのユニットと同じように、\n君の力を貸してやってくれるかね？", "zh": "你可以像协助之前的团体一样，\n也为她们尽一份心力吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_1029", "source_sha256": "6a3c6e02573e72742692ee9436e0ffa33ebd2652254aee49c47cf29382dfa28d", "ja": "貸します！", "zh": "可以！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "8d17b08f2d6924e29dc2d91f18353c590d191059dd69a9016ccbcdb0e6080104", "ja": "貸します！　いや、貸すというよりも……\n全力を尽くします。それがプロデュースですから！", "zh": "可以！不，不只是尽一份心力……\n我会用尽全力，那样才称得上是培育！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "5061eb9e680cfe88249d9aa8ec9fbfa97f95db7141ba6d21fb0a5c820f6c9bc4", "ja": "はっはっは、君ならそう言ってくれると思っていたよ！\nでは、今回もひとつ、よろしく頼むよ！", "zh": "哈哈哈！我就知道你会这么说！\n那么，这次也交给你啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_2002_101kot", "source_sha256": "ca6a2880ce3d9829ef75b689c30e190f21efbeb3b8c6c30d33db99836fb833f5", "ja": "ふう。えっと、私も楽しみにしています！\n頑張ってくださいね、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "呼~那个，我也很期待！\n请你加油喔，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_intro_2003_p", "source_sha256": "12f95f2fd29990836f2c2146f6e4102061df6b19bac84a0ed9f23f3bb957df0d", "ja": "（ミルキーウェイ……そうだな。まさに天の川のように\n不思議と人を惹きつけるユニットになりそうだ！）", "zh": "（『Milky Way』……的确，她们应该能成为\n一个有如银河般散发神秘魅力的团体！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
